---
description: Grails project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Read docs/HANDOFF.md first (state, release steps, gotchas), then PROGRESS.md.

- Swift 6, SwiftUI + AppKit, XcodeGen (project.yml is the source; run `xcodegen`). Never run the whole `swift test` suite (it hangs): use `--filter`.
- Quit any running Grails before running a GRAILS_*_DEMO check.
- UI copy minimal, quiet flat design, Geist Mono titles / Geist text, no bounce, ease-out <= 240 ms.
- No Claude or Co-Authored-By trailers. Commit locally; push and publish only as docs/HANDOFF.md describes or when the owner says so.
- Ask the owner before shipping visual changes. Do not commit Package.resolved noise, build/, dist/, icon-preview/.
- After every install to /Applications run Scripts/reset-app.sh.
